# From mutations/step-28-fetch.breaks (part `fetch`).
# Step 28, the fetch client behind extensions' `cineris.http.fetch`
# (crates/cineris-llm/src/fetch.rs): each rule broken one at a time. The
# addresses outside the internet, the IPv6 forms of them, the allowance,
# every address checked, one lookup and a connection to a checked address,
# no proxy, no redirect, the refused headers, the schemes and the limits.

